<title>HONG KONG: Lee Hing Dev interim net down 35.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Lee Hing Dev interim net down 35.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.46	vs 21.20</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    8.0	  vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  10.26 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    43.40	vs 67.26</p>
<p>    Turnover		     130.35     vs 66.91</p>
<p>    Company name		 Lee Hing Development Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 18-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Lee Hing Development engages in investment holdings, property investment and development and trading in listed shares.</p>
<p>Net is after an associated company exceptional item of HK$10.26 million gain on disposal of subsidiary companies.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
